# builtins.si — standard built-ins example
# Demonstrates range, length, count, and loading values from another source file.
# Key components: numbers range and imported-values fixture.
# Built-ins and source-value loading
numbers is range(1, 5)
Say numbers
Say length(numbers)
Say count(numbers)
Say length("Simply")

open "imported-values.si" as imported
Say imported[1]
